marked 15.0.12

Vendored from node_modules/marked by the Cloudflare port (P4). One file,
copied verbatim:

  marked.min.js  ->  marked.min.js

WHY IT IS HERE. PORT-CLOUDFLARE.md §6 moves document conversion to the
uploader's browser; public/js/upload-cf.js loads this on demand for a .md/.markdown
submit and parses with the SAME options src/services/ingest/text.js uses in Node
(`gfm: true, breaks: false` — the CommonMark rule, so a hard-wrapped paragraph
reflows and a deliberate line break is asked for the Markdown way). The .txt path
does not touch this file at all: it uses the paragraph/verse heuristic ported
alongside it in upload-cf.js.

Same version as the Node dependency, so a .md file converts identically on either
stack.

It is a UMD bundle and publishes `window.marked`. Loaded from this origin because
the CSP is `script-src 'self'` — nothing is ever fetched from a CDN.

To upgrade: bump marked in package.json, re-copy the file, rewrite the version
line above, and re-run an upload of the .md fixture end to end.
